### English Assistant — English UI strings
###
### Every id carries the ea- prefix: all plugins' ftl files merge into one L10n source,
### so colliding ids would overwrite each other.
### Section headers use .label, sidenav buttons use .tooltiptext, menu items use .label —
### the same form Zotero uses. A bare value would leave the header blank.

## Translation section (formerly DeepSeek Translate)

ea-translate-pane-header =
    .label = AI Translate
ea-translate-pane-sidenav =
    .tooltiptext = AI Translate
ea-translate-button-settings =
    .tooltiptext = Settings
ea-translate-button-clear =
    .tooltiptext = Clear history

## Word frequency section (formerly Word Frequency)

ea-wordfreq-pane-header =
    .label = Whole-document Frequency
ea-wordfreq-pane-sidenav =
    .tooltiptext = Whole-document Frequency

## Word book

ea-wordbook-tools-open =
    .label = Word Book…
ea-wordfreq-parts-header =
    .label = Section Frequency
ea-wordfreq-parts-sidenav =
    .tooltiptext = Section Frequency
